<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month T-bill yield eases to 21.84 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month T-bill yield eases to 21.84 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.84 percent on Tuesday, down from 21.88 percent at a previous auction, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	   1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received    1,530.32 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	  1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.84 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.3566 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
